From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hermes <hermes@lassul.us>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Build as a module of the droid-nix app

droid-nix carries Termux:API in its own APK instead of a separate app
that shares its user id. droid-nix copies this repository into its
termux-app tree, whose settings.gradle includes app/ as the library
module ":termux-api" and whose app depends on it:

- build.gradle: com.android.library with the SDK versions of the
  termux-app tree and its termux-shared module; no application id,
  version, signing, minification or APK names, which are the app's;
- manifest: no sharedUserId, application attributes, launcher alias or
  ReportActivity, the app has its own; the manifest placeholders are
  the app's. Drop READ_PRIVILEGED_PHONE_STATE (system apps only) and
  REQUEST_DELETE_PACKAGES (unused);
- TermuxAPIApplication is not used, the app has its own application
  class with logging and crash handling; the receiver sets
  ResultReturner's context, which every API call needs;
- the receiver's class name no longer follows from the package name,
  which is the app's.
